---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import InnerHero from '../../components/InnerHero.astro';
import { company } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How Sentrum Communication & Technologies Ltd handles the personal information you send through this website.">
<InnerHero layout="plain" kicker="Legal" crumbs={[{ href: '/privacy/', label: 'Privacy' }]} title="Privacy notice" lede="What we collect when you contact us through this website, why, and what you can ask us to do with it." cta={{ href: `mailto:${company.email}`, label: 'Email a privacy question' }} />
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap legal-w">
  <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page"><p class="k">On this page</p><ol><li><a href="#who-we-are">Who we are</a></li><li><a href="#what-we-collect">What we collect</a></li><li><a href="#why-we-use-it">Why we use it</a></li><li><a href="#where-it-is-stored">Where it is stored</a></li><li><a href="#how-long-we-keep-it">How long we keep it</a></li><li><a href="#cookies-and-tracking">Cookies and tracking</a></li><li><a href="#your-rights">Your rights</a></li></ol></nav>
  <div class="prose">
    <p><b>Last updated:</b> September 2026</p>
    <h2 id="who-we-are">Who we are</h2>
    <p>{company.name}, {company.address}, {company.city}, {company.country}, is responsible for personal information collected through this website. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="what-we-collect">What we collect</h2>
    <p>Only what you type into the enquiry form: your name, organisation, email address, phone number, site location, the topic you choose and your message.</p>
    <h2 id="why-we-use-it">Why we use it</h2>
    <p>To reply to your enquiry, arrange a site visit if you ask for one, and prepare a quote. We do not sell your information or use it for unrelated marketing.</p>
    <h2 id="where-it-is-stored">Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>Enquiries are stored securely within the European Union, where an engineer reviews and responds to them.</p>
    <h2 id="how-long-we-keep-it">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>For as long as we need it to respond to you and, if you become a client, for our normal business records.</p>
    <h2 id="cookies-and-tracking">Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies, and loads no third-party trackers. Fonts are served from our own site.</p>
    <h2 id="your-rights">Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under Kenya’s Data Protection Act, 2019 you can ask to see the information we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted, or object to how we use it. Email <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a> and we will respond.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
